<title>SINGAPORE: Omni Mold sells stake in joint venture.</title>
<headline>Omni Mold sells stake in joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omni Mold Ltd said on Tuesday it has concluded an agreement to sell its 50 percent stake in a joint venture company.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement that The Tech Group Inc will buy Omni's stake in Omni-Tech Molding Pte Ltd for S$1.43 million.</p>
<p>Omni said the sale will have no impact on its earnings per share while the net tangible asset backing per share will rise to 18.28 Singapore cents from the current 17.67 cents.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
